{"seq":2,"slug":"the-bit-as-unit","title":"比特：信息的计量单位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/measuring-information/the-bit-as-unit","wordCount":1748,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"比特-信息的计量单位\">比特：信息的计量单位</h1><p>有了熵这把尺子，还得给它定一个刻度单位。香农的选择是&quot;比特&quot;（bit，binary digit 的缩写，这个词由他的贝尔实验室同事约翰·图基提议，经香农 1948 年的论文而广为人知）。一个比特，就是一次&quot;二选一&quot;所携带的信息量——是或否、开或关、零或一。这个看似微不足道的小单位，最终成了人类存储与传输一切信息的通用货币。</p>\n<p>把比特定义为&quot;一次均匀的二选一&quot;，是因为这恰好是不确定性的最小非平凡单位。少于两个选项就没有不确定性可言（结果已定，信息为零）；而两个等概率选项的不确定性，正好被规定为一个单位。一切更复杂的信息量，都可以用比特来累加和换算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>比特之所以成为单位，根源在于熵公式用的是以 2 为底的对数。对一次等概率的二选一：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 比特</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = -\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\log_2\\tfrac{1}{2} + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\log_2\\tfrac{1}{2}\\right) = \\log_2 2 = 1 \\text{ 比特}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>底数的选择决定了单位的名字：底为 2 得比特，底为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 得&quot;奈特&quot;（nat），底为 10 得&quot;哈特利&quot;（hartley）。三者只差一个常数倍，可以自由换算，但比特因为对应物理上最容易实现的二态器件（开关、高低电平、磁极方向），成了工程上的事实标准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[1 比特&lt;br/&gt;一次二选一] --&gt; B[2 比特&lt;br/&gt;四选一 2x2]&#10;  A --&gt; C[N 比特&lt;br/&gt;区分 2 的 N 次方 种状态]&#10;  C --&gt; D[8 比特 = 1 字节&lt;br/&gt;区分 256 种状态]&#10;  D --&gt; E[KB / MB / GB&lt;br/&gt;日常存储单位]\">flowchart TD\n  A[1 比特&lt;br/&gt;一次二选一] --&gt; B[2 比特&lt;br/&gt;四选一 2x2]\n  A --&gt; C[N 比特&lt;br/&gt;区分 2 的 N 次方 种状态]\n  C --&gt; D[8 比特 = 1 字节&lt;br/&gt;区分 256 种状态]\n  D --&gt; E[KB / MB / GB&lt;br/&gt;日常存储单位]</pre><p>用比特数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 能区分的等概率状态数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；反过来，区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 种等概率状态需要的比特数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。下表给出几个常见对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比特数</th>\n<th>可区分的状态数</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>真 / 假、开 / 关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8（1 字节）</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>一个 ASCII 扩展字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>65536</td>\n<td>一个常用汉字（足够覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>约 43 亿</td>\n<td>一个 IPv4 地址</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-二选一-是信息的原子\">为什么&quot;二选一&quot;是信息的原子</h2><p>香农选二进制，不是因为偏爱数字 2，而是因为任何选择都可以拆解成一连串的二选一。要在 8 个等概率选项中确定一个，你可以问三个&quot;是非题&quot;：在前一半吗？在剩下的前一半吗？在剩下的前一半吗？三个二选一恰好锁定一个，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 8 = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 比特。</p>\n<p>这种&quot;用是非题逼近答案&quot;的视角，把信息量变得极其直观：一条消息的信息量，就是&quot;最少要问几个是非题才能从所有可能里把它确定下来&quot;。这也解释了为什么前一篇里掷骰子是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>6</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.58</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 6 \\approx 2.58</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.58</span></span></span></span></span> 比特——它介于&quot;问 2 个是非题（4 选 1）&quot;和&quot;问 3 个是非题（8 选 1）&quot;之间。</p>\n<p>正因为二选一是不可再分的选择原子，比特才成了信息的&quot;夸克&quot;：再大的文件、再长的视频，归根结底都是一长串 0 和 1，都是一连串被回答了的是非题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从抽象单位到物理现实\">从抽象单位到物理现实</h2><p>比特的威力，在于它彻底抹平了不同媒介之间的鸿沟。在比特出现之前，文字、声音、图像各有各的存储和传输方式，互不相通。一旦都被量化成比特，它们在工程上就再无本质区别——同一根光纤、同一块硬盘、同一套纠错算法，可以无差别地处理一封邮件、一首歌、一部电影。</p>\n<p>这种统一带来了一个常被忽视却影响深远的后果：不同媒介之间的界限消失后，技术进步可以一次惠及所有领域。当工程师改进了硬盘的存储密度，受益的不只是文本，照片、音乐、视频一并获益，因为它们在硬盘看来都只是比特。当数学家发明了更好的纠错码，保护的也不只是某一种数据，而是所有被编码成比特的东西。这种&quot;一次改进、处处受益&quot;的杠杆效应，正是数字技术在过去几十年呈指数级进步的深层原因之一——而它的起点，是香农坚持把一切都先化约成同一种最朴素的计量单位。</p>\n<p>这正是数字革命的技术内核：把万物先翻译成比特，再统一处理。香农 1937 年的硕士论文已经为&quot;用二态器件搭建逻辑&quot;铺好了物理基础（见<a href=\"../../major-works/the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching\">布尔代数与开关电路</a>），而 1948 年的比特概念则为&quot;用二态符号承载信息&quot;提供了度量语言。两者合流，才有了今天的数字世界。</p>\n<p>需要厘清一个常见混淆：作为信息单位的&quot;比特&quot;和作为存储单位的&quot;比特&quot;并不完全等同，详见下一节的边界讨论。关于这个单位作为成果的定位，见<a href=\"../../core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/quantifying-information\">量化信息</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权衡与边界-比特作为单位的两难\">权衡与边界：比特作为单位的两难</h2><p>比特之所以能统一度量，代价是它把一切都化约成同一种最朴素的单位——这既是它的力量，也藏着几个需要保持清醒的边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>成立的场景</th>\n<th>边界与反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单位选择</td>\n<td>二态器件最易物理实现</td>\n<td>奈特/哈特利在连续信源中更自然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量对象</td>\n<td>信息的量（不确定性）</td>\n<td>不度量信息的价值、真伪与意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比特 vs 字节</td>\n<td>带宽与信息论惯用比特</td>\n<td>存储惯用字节，换算差 8 倍，易出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息量</td>\n<td>可为小数（如 0.24 比特）</td>\n<td>存储位只能是整数，二者之差即压缩空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最需澄清的是最后一行的混淆：作为<strong>信息单位</strong>的比特（一次选择的信息量，可以是小数）与作为<strong>存储单位</strong>的比特（一个 0/1 存储位，只能是整数）并不等同。前者是香农的理论量，后者是工程实现。一个高度可预测的信源，每个符号的信息熵可能远小于 1 比特，用整数个存储位去保存它必然有浪费——这个浪费，正是数据压缩要回收的空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>比特（binary digit）是一次均匀二选一所携带的信息量，由熵公式取以 2 为底的对数自然得出。</li>\n<li>底数决定单位名称（比特 / 奈特 / 哈特利），三者可换算，比特因对应物理二态器件成为工程标准。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个比特可区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种等概率状态；区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 种状态需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 比特。</li>\n<li>任何选择都可拆成一连串是非题，所以二选一是信息不可再分的原子。</li>\n<li>比特抹平了文字、声音、图像之间的媒介差异，是数字革命的统一计量语言。</li>\n<li>须区分&quot;信息单位的比特&quot;（可为小数）与&quot;存储位的比特&quot;（整数），二者之差正是压缩空间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"比特：信息的计量单位","id":"比特-信息的计量单位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么\"二选一\"是信息的原子","id":"为什么-二选一-是信息的原子"},{"level":2,"text":"从抽象单位到物理现实","id":"从抽象单位到物理现实"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与边界：比特作为单位的两难","id":"权衡与边界-比特作为单位的两难"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信息即不确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/measuring-information/information-as-uncertainty"},"next":{"title":"信道容量：传输的物理极限","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding/channel-capacity"}}